---
title: "A run is judged by what its runner wrote"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: before the run
  s1: the run is refused by Own path
  s2: the run is recorded
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the runner runs a commit that writes a folder of no Goal or the runner runs a commit that writes another Goal's folder
  s0 --> s2: the runner runs its commit
